bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
bond_coeff      1 0.0 0.9572
angle_coeff     1 0.0 104.52
kspace_style    pppm/samqeq 1.0e-5
kspace_modify   gewald 0.30
Updated KSpace settings:
  KSpace computation is turned:    ON
  Use MPI collective operations:   OFF
  Use MPI non-blocking operations: OFF
  Gewald manually set to:          0.3
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 2 delay 4 check yes one 10000
fix             shk all shake 1.0e-4 50 0 b 1 a 1
Finding SHAKE clusters ...
       0 = # of size 2 clusters
       0 = # of size 3 clusters
       0 = # of size 4 clusters
    3800 = # of frozen angles
  find clusters CPU = 0.001 seconds

fix             chg FQ qeq/sam 1 0.0 8.0 1.0e-5 cucell.param
fix_modify      chg shield pqeq
samqeq: lr-solve shielding = PQEq Gaussian erf(a_ij r)/r (param 4th col = Rc (Gaussian radius)); routed through compute_H + add_fixed_charge_field + the legacy gas path (calc_Hval)
fix_modify      chg quartic watO 115.30 0.0 8 0.5
samqeq: QUARTIC near-crit cure ON (group watO c4=115.3 c=0 niter=8 mix=0.50 fld0=0 qref=0); c4 term centered on q; damped-Picard SCF, q-only (no force term)
fix_modify      chg ridge eig ${RIDGE} 15 10
fix_modify      chg ridge eig 69.1815 15 10
samqeq: ridge mode = Lanczos lambda_min: ridge = max(lr_ridge, 69.18-lambda_min) eV, 15 Lanczos steps, recomputed every 10 step(s) (continuous in config; matrix kept PD)
fix_modify      chg energy yes
fix_modify      chg aspc 2 3
samqeq: ASPC q-direct predictor-corrector ON (order k=3, n_corr=2, omega=0.5556, rtol=0.01); fixed-iteration corrector off a time-reversible predictor, accept only if rel-resid<rtol else BO (BO<->XL middle ground, #16)
# F3 re-measurement: s71 requires this choice to be explicit. 'off' reproduces the
# pre-s71 ion-blind behaviour, which is what release ad36dcb does by construction.
fix_modify      chg ionfield ${IONF}
fix_modify      chg ionfield off
WARNING: samqeq: ionfield explicitly OFF — fixed non-group charged atoms (ions) are in the FORCES but NOT in the QEq solve (ion-blind Hamiltonian, acknowledged by the deck). Valid as a control or a legacy reproduction; say so when quoting physics. (src/SAMQEQ/fix_qeq_sam_electrode.cpp:484)

compute         Tw water temp
thermo          100
balance         1.0 rcb
